      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">1. Trading platforms must operate under recognized regulatory frameworks</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"></span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">2. Price data should reflect real international market conditions</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"5\"></span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"6\">3. Transparent trading terms and clear disclosures are essential</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"7\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"8\"></span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"9\">4. User funds and transactions must follow defined operational standards</span>",
